{{also|chickenhawk}}
==English==

===Etymology===
[[chicken]] (in the Old English sense of ''[[cycen]]'': young fowl, its alleged primary prey) + [[hawk]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[chicken]] [[hawk]]}}

# {{context|archaic|lang=en}} Any of the North American [[hawk]] species ([[Cooper's hawk]], [[sharp-shinned hawk]] and [[red-tailed hawk]]), or counterparts elsewhere, mistakenly believed to be [[pest]]s.
# {{context|British|US|gay slang|lang=en}} An [[adult]] male preferring younger male [[sexual partner]]s.
# {{context|pejorative|political|slang|lang=en}} An advocate of [[war]] or military action who is avoiding personal [[military service]], or avoided it in the past.

